@startuml
!include theme.puml
title Finance and payroll | Implementation class collaboration
top to bottom direction
interface PaymentGateway {
  +request_to_pay(reference, amount_xaf, payer_msisdn)
  +get_status(reference, requested_at, payer_msisdn)
}
class MtnMomoGateway {
  -_access_token
  -_token_expires_at
  +request_to_pay(...)
  +get_status(...)
}
class "CamerPayTestDoubleGateway" as TestGateway {
  +request_to_pay(...)
  +get_status(...)
}
class PaymentIntent {
  id: UUID
  invoice_id: UUID
  provider_reference: unique string
  amount_xaf: integer
  status: pending | succeeded | failed
}
class Invoice {
  id: UUID
  enrollment_id: opaque UUID
  student_id: opaque UUID
  amount_xaf: integer
  status: pending | paid
}
class Receipt {
  invoice_id: UUID
  payment_intent_id: UUID
  amount_xaf: integer
}
class "reconciliation module" as Reconcile <<module>> {
  +reconcile_intent(session, gateway, intent_id)
}
class "ledger module" as Ledger <<module>> {
  +post_balanced(session, institution_id, lines, description)
}
class LedgerLine <<frozen dataclass>> {
  entry_type
  direction
  amount_xaf
  reference_type
  reference_id
}
class ScheduleRates <<frozen dataclass>> {
  cnps_employee_rate: Decimal
  cnps_employer_rate: Decimal
  cnps_ceiling_xaf: integer
  standard_deduction_rate: Decimal
  irpp_brackets: list
}
class PayslipBreakdown <<frozen dataclass>> {
  gross_xaf
  cnps_employee_xaf
  cnps_employer_xaf
  taxable_base_xaf
  irpp_xaf
  net_xaf
}
class "payroll module" as Payroll <<module>> {
  +calculate_payslip(gross_xaf, schedule)
  -_apply_irpp_brackets(base, brackets)
  -_round_xaf(value)
}
PaymentGateway <|.. MtnMomoGateway
PaymentGateway <|.. TestGateway
Reconcile ..> PaymentGateway : queries
Reconcile ..> PaymentIntent : locks / transitions
Reconcile ..> Invoice : locks / settles
Reconcile ..> Receipt : creates
Reconcile ..> Ledger : posts on success
Ledger ..> LedgerLine : balances
Invoice "1" -- "0..*" PaymentIntent
Invoice "1" -- "0..1" Receipt
Payroll ..> ScheduleRates : reads
Payroll ..> PayslipBreakdown : returns
note bottom of Payroll
Class diagram uses real ORM/dataclass/protocol concepts.
Module boxes are functions, not invented service classes.
Payroll has no call to Finance and does not transfer funds.
end note
@enduml
